    - character:
        name: Interviewee?
        icon: {fileID: 1590803138, guid: 3932dd27a1b0ccc4f8cdd01eb1cd35c1, type: 3}
      line: Huh? Whaddya want?
    - character:
        name: Epic Name Here
        icon: {fileID: 1590803138, guid: 3932dd27a1b0ccc4f8cdd01eb1cd35c1, type: 3}
      line: Oh, sorry, I was just trying to get by... are you in line?
    - character:
        name: Interviewee?
        icon: {fileID: 1590803138, guid: 3932dd27a1b0ccc4f8cdd01eb1cd35c1, type: 3}
      line: In line? For what?
    - character:
        name: Epic Name Here
        icon: {fileID: 1590803138, guid: 3932dd27a1b0ccc4f8cdd01eb1cd35c1, type: 3}
      line: ...The interview?
    - character:
        name: Interviewee?
        icon: {fileID: 1590803138, guid: 3932dd27a1b0ccc4f8cdd01eb1cd35c1, type: 3}
      line: What? No, I just like standing in lines.
    - character:
        name: Epic Name Here
        icon: {fileID: 1590803138, guid: 3932dd27a1b0ccc4f8cdd01eb1cd35c1, type: 3}
      line: ...Oh.
